{
  "source": "Prompts/your-home-base-v9.mp4",
  "duration": 190.1013125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.72,
      "text": "When you sit down to use AI, your first decision is which app to open."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.26,
      "end": 9.1,
      "text": "Three names you'll hear constantly are ChatGPT from OpenAI,"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.98,
      "end": 12.26,
      "text": "Claude from Anthropic, and Gemini from Google."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.0,
      "end": 15.96,
      "text": "All three can chat, write code, and answer questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.62,
      "end": 21.0,
      "text": "So if they all do essentially the same things, why does it matter which one you pick?"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.68,
      "end": 23.24,
      "text": "Think about it like a burger place."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.86,
      "end": 27.92,
      "text": "In-N-Out and McDonald's both build cheeseburgers from roughly the same ingredients."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.92,
      "end": 33.22,
      "text": "Yet they provide completely different experiences because each company operates on a different"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.22,
      "end": 35.1,
      "text": "idea of what a restaurant should be."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.6,
      "end": 39.2,
      "text": "One focuses on a tiny menu with everything made fresh to order."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.72,
      "end": 43.0,
      "text": "The other is engineered for maximum speed, massive scale,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.32,
      "end": 46.12,
      "text": "and being exactly identical in every city on earth."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.84,
      "end": 49.06,
      "text": "The big three AI apps work the same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.48,
      "end": 52.62,
      "text": "They all rely on AI models that learn patterns during training."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.04,
      "end": 56.68,
      "text": "But each company makes distinct choices about how to train those models,"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.68,
      "end": 60.58,
      "text": "what to build into their app, and how the system acts when it isn't sure."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.36,
      "end": 66.4,
      "text": "Those choices determine how each app feels, what specific tasks it excels at,"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.64,
      "end": 67.64,
      "text": "and how it behaves."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.42,
      "end": 71.0,
      "text": "This board breaks down the big three side by side."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.62,
      "end": 74.4,
      "text": "We can think of ChatGPT as the anything box."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 79.06,
      "text": "It acts as one general purpose AI app designed for a wide range of tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.52,
      "end": 83.08,
      "text": "You ask questions, create things, and get help with your daily work."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.73,
      "end": 86.54,
      "text": "This comes directly from OpenAI's driving question."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.3,
      "end": 89.72,
      "text": "How do we put capable AI in everyone's hands?"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.06,
      "end": 92.46,
      "text": "Claude acts as the thinking partner."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.12,
      "end": 97.52,
      "text": "It functions specifically as an assistant for working through complex ideas and difficult"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.52,
      "end": 98.56,
      "text": "multi-step tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.5,
      "end": 102.9,
      "text": "Anthropic places a strong emphasis on safety and predictable behavior,"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.36,
      "end": 106.88,
      "text": "asking, how do we build powerful AI we can actually trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.9,
      "end": 109.16,
      "text": "Gemini takes a different approach."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.7,
      "end": 112.6,
      "text": "It acts as the AI assistant built directly into Google."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.16,
      "end": 116.28,
      "text": "Its main advantage shows up when your work connects to the Google tools"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.28,
      "end": 117.92,
      "text": "you already use on a daily basis."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.74,
      "end": 120.86,
      "text": "Google's guiding question focuses on integration."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.68,
      "end": 124.68,
      "text": "How do we put AI inside the tools people already use?"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.18,
      "end": 128.52,
      "text": "Each app has distinct strengths born from these specific philosophies,"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.88,
      "end": 132.16,
      "text": "but you will find massive overlap in what they can accomplish day to day."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.74,
      "end": 136.24,
      "text": "Because of this overlap, any of the three tools will do the job for most tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.72,
      "end": 138.1,
      "text": "Do not agonize over the choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.42,
      "end": 142.14,
      "text": "There is no single best app, and what is best today might change by next week."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.14,
      "end": 145.58,
      "text": "Claude currently requires users to be at least 18 years old."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.02,
      "end": 148.14,
      "text": "We still cover it because knowing your options matters,"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.52,
      "end": 149.8,
      "text": "even before you can access them."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.38,
      "end": 153.0,
      "text": "For this course, ChatGPT is your designated home base."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.6,
      "end": 156.36,
      "text": "Learn it deeply, its settings, its features, its quirks."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.98,
      "end": 159.7,
      "text": "Knowing one app thoroughly beats shallow dabbling in all three."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.34,
      "end": 162.06,
      "text": "Later, you can try a specific strategy."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.64,
      "end": 164.46,
      "text": "Ask a second app the exact same question."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.88,
      "end": 166.66,
      "text": "It might catch a detail the first app missed"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.66,
      "end": 169.02,
      "text": "or suggest a completely different approach to the problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.02,
      "end": 172.96,
      "text": "If the two apps disagree, you have something to investigate."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.68,
      "end": 176.08,
      "text": "But keep in mind, even if they agree perfectly,"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.58,
      "end": 178.48,
      "text": "that does not guarantee they are right."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.56,
      "end": 180.42,
      "text": "Pick a home base."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.0,
      "end": 181.64,
      "text": "Learn it deeply."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.18,
      "end": 183.1,
      "text": "The skills transfer."
    },
    {
      "start": 183.72,
      "end": 185.32,
      "text": "The app is just where you practice them."
    }
  ],
